      "properties": {
        "reported": true,
        "property_type": "magnetic",
        "summary": "Weak ferromagnetic coupling between adjacent Dy(III) ions (positive Weiss constant) with χMT nearly constant from 300 to 50 K then decreasing to 2 K. Zero-dc-field ac susceptibility shows frequency-dependent in-phase and out-of-phase signals and SMM-like slow magnetic relaxation (QTM tails below 5 K). Arrhenius fit of relaxation times gives ΔE/kB = 46.4 K and τ0 = 9.2×10−7 s; Cole–Cole α = 0.20–0.45.",
